# Working tree ini = network share ke server live (Linux). Jangan pernah
# biarkan Git mengubah line ending file, karena file langsung dipakai server.
* text=auto eol=lf

# File batch Windows: simpan apa adanya (CRLF). cmd.exe bisa salah baca
# label/goto kalau file .bat dinormalisasi jadi LF.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
